# S0p: a fan-out main, then a heavier fan-out fork whose connects may flush mid-op (a reconcile
# follows its mirror); a KILL and a CLEAN restart after the mirrors.
# It starts in IBD and leaves it at its second block, whose LEFT_IBD freeze the fan-out blocks
# build on: a restore at T_RECENT arms no LEFT_IBD (BL-969).
start old
extend main 1
warp 30
extend main 8 tx=fan
extend main 8 tx=fan
fork 3 8 tx=fan
extend b1 8 tx=fan
restart kill
extend main 2 tx=fan
restart clean
extend main 1
